flowchart LR
    Dev[Developer] --> Repo[GitHub repository]
    Repo --> CI[GitHub Actions\nTests · dependency check · Docker validation]
    Dev --> TF[Terraform]
    TF --> EC2[AWS EC2 instance]
    App[Node.js application] -. container image .-> ECR[Amazon ECR]
    ECR --> EC2
    EC2 --> CW[Amazon CloudWatch]
    Operator[Operator] --> SSM[AWS Systems Manager]
    SSM --> EC2
    User[Client] -->|HTTP| EC2
    EC2 -->|/ and /health| User
